# 逆転裁判3 (Gyakuten Saiban 3, AGB-A3JJ): the game's own numbers for its characters, as the script has them
# (16-bit, the low byte first, so 00C0 is written C000). The font is in the cartridge at 0x1EF1CC + 128 x the
# code, four 4-bit tiles a glyph, codes 0x80 to 0x67F. Of its glyphs 1,324 are the same, bit for bit, as a glyph
# of Gyakuten Saiban 2's font (1,230) or Gyakuten Saiban's (94) and take that reading (games/gba/AGB-A3GJ.tbl,
# AGB-ASBJ.tbl); 212 others, redrawn or new, were read here off sheets, once, by one reader.
